<title>NEW ZEALAND: Summary of RBNZ economic projections.</title>
<headline>Summary of RBNZ economic projections.</headline>
<dateline>WELLINGTON 1996-09-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following is a summary of key economic projections released by the Reserve Bank of New Zealand on Friday.</p>
<p>Figures in brackets are forecasts released by the RB in their March forecasts, except inflation series which are from the June Monetary Policy Statement.</p>
<p>Figures are for March years.</p>
